      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching search",
          "heading": "Jake White's Fiji assistant hunt still open, no appointment announced",
          "body": "Jake White's search for a South African assistant to complete his Fiji staff remains unresolved. Mid-October reporting said White was turning to a trusted Springbok ally, but no name has been confirmed and no appointment has been reported since. Until that happens, the coaching group is incomplete, with the November block against France, Ireland and Italy the next test for the new set-up."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa without Kolbe and Etzebeth through injury for Nations Championship",
