    "386": {
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "edition": "Thursday 29 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Discipline row",
          "heading": "Brian Moore says Henry Pollock's Premiership brawl may affect Borthwick's starting choices",
          "body": "Brian Moore has warned that Henry Pollock's needling during Saturday's Leicester-Northampton scuffle could cost him in Steve Borthwick's selections. Pollock wound up Tigers pair Ollie Chessum and Freddie Steward, and Leicester went on to win 28-7, scoring four tries after the flashpoint. Writing in the Telegraph, Moore said the episode \"may have repercussions when it comes to Steve Borthwick's starting choices for the final rounds of next month's Nations Championship.\""
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa without Kolbe and Etzebeth through injury for Nations Championship",
