      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thomas Gallo out at least six months; Rodrigo Martínez called up",
          "body": "Argentina have lost prop Thomas Gallo for at least six months after he dislocated his left wrist in Lyon's 31-27 win at Bayonne and had surgery on Saturday. Dragons loosehead Rodrigo Martínez, who has four Test caps, has come into Felipe Contepomi's squad as cover. It is another blow for the Pumas, with Santiago Carreras, who has 70 Test caps, set to miss the rest of the season after a serious knee injury for Bath."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa without Kolbe and Etzebeth through injury for Nations Championship",
