          "heading": "Japan Rugby names a 35-player roster for the Nation Series",
          "body": "Japan Rugby has named a 35-player roster for the Nation Series, a wider group than any match-day squad and a sign of who the staff is keeping close. Coming off a 28-34 defeat to Fiji, the list will show how the group is being built. Coverage in today's press has not carried the individual names or the reasons behind the choices, so the detail will have to come from the announcement itself."
